# The Lost Chalice

A published quest quest. Adventurers, party gold, and the hoard stay
inside this box. Other pages may call only the names listed under Public.

## Schema

```
Quest = String/title Party Hoard
Party = Adventurer/hero Adventurer/companion
Adventurer = String/name Int/level Int/gold
Hoard = String/relic Int/value
```

## Construction

```
[:Quest
  "The Lost Chalice"
  [:Party [:Adventurer "Mira Oakenshield" 3 12] [:Adventurer "Thorn the Quiet" 2 8]]
  [:Hoard "silver chalice" 400]
]
```

## Methods

```
Quest::headline = { title }

Quest::roster = { party.hero.name.concat(" and ").concat(party.companion.name) }

Quest::gold = { party.hero.gold + party.companion.gold + hoard.value }
```

## Public

```
make = { String/title, String/heroName, String/companionName |
  [:Quest
    title
    [:Party [:Adventurer heroName 3 12] [:Adventurer companionName 2 8]]
    [:Hoard "silver chalice" 400]]
}
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var quest = QuestAssemblage.factory();
    trace(quest.headline());
    trace(quest.roster());
    trace(quest.gold());
}
```
